                               BBS-Add v1.0
                               ------------

 BBS-Add is a very simple tool, that let's the user add's his/hers board to
 your log-out text. When ran, the user will be asked for the name of the
 board and the phone#, the modemspeed, and finaly what program he/she runs
 the board on. Then BBS-Add will ask the user if yhat he entered is correct.
 Answering yes will add the fact's into either SYStext:sys.end, or 
 SYStext:tt2.end. Answerin no, the user will have to answer the questions 
 once again.


                               Installation
                               ------------

 Installation is a very simple matter. Just add it to your Pfiles-list as
 an AREXX-script, and add as an argument the file you wan't the bbs-facts
 to be written to (eg. 'sys.end' or 'tt2.end' ) and save it.


